// Title: DevTest Labs / VM auto-shutdown schedules
// Purpose: Which VMs have an auto-shutdown schedule, at what time, in which time zone, enabled or not.
// Source table(s): Azure Resource Graph, resources (microsoft.devtestlab/schedules)
// Parameters to edit: none.
// Notes/traps: the VM auto-shutdown setting in the portal is stored as a microsoft.devtestlab/schedules
//          resource named shutdown-computevm-<vmname>. The time is HHmm in the schedule's own time zone.
resources
| where type =~ 'microsoft.devtestlab/schedules'
| project name, resourceGroup, subscriptionId,
    status = tostring(properties.status),
    dailyTime = tostring(properties.dailyRecurrence.time),
    timeZone = tostring(properties.timeZoneId),
    target = tostring(properties.targetResourceId)
